cy trading and marketing segment in the quarter and continues to focus on asset-light digital solution initiatives, including the EPR certificate trading portal, the TReDS platform, and a travel portal. Furthermore, the company's joint venture with Mahindra (MMRPL) posted a positive PAT for the first time in multiple quarters, supported by higher feedstock inflows from vehicle scrapping.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company attempts to maintain double-digit growth in e-commerce year-on-year if possible.","quote":"It would not be fair to put a number to it, but the attempt shall be to maintain a double-digit growth if possible.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management expects the positive trend in feedstock inflows and financial outlook for the Mahindra joint venture to strengthen and continue.","quote":"And we expect this trend to strengthen and continue, driving towards a healthy financial outlook for this company.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"EBITDA percentage of total income was 69.05%, which is nearly 3% higher than the corresponding period of FY26.","quote":"EBITDA percentage of total income was 69.05%, also nearly 3% higher than the corresponding period of FY26.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"Total expenses increased by 16%, driven by normal increases in salaries and wages and inflationary pressures.","quote":"So, it is generally a normal increase due to increase in the salaries and wages, normal salary wages and inflationary pressure.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"Standalone expenses for the quarter were INR 36.51 crore compared to INR 31.78 crore in the corresponding previous period.","quote":"Expenses 36.51 31.78 14.88%","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf"},{"claim":"Consolidated expenses for Q1 FY 2026-27 stood at INR 39.47 crore.","quote":"Expenses\n39.47 34.03 15.99%","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf"},{"claim":"The company has been able to maintain the EBITDA percentage at a similar level year-on-year despite competition.","quote":"With respect to the financials, we have been able to maintain EBITDA percentage at a similar level year-on-year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"},{"claim":"EBITDA stood at INR307.49 crores in '25-'26 versus INR260.04 crores in '24-'25, marking an increase of around 18.2% on a year-to-year basis.","quote":"EBITDA stands at INR307.49 crores in '25-'26 vis-a-vis INR260.04 crores '24-'25, around an increase of 18.2% on a year-to-year basis.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"MSTC will conduct the 15th round of Commercial Coal Block Auctions containing 17 mines.","quote":"MSTCwillconduct the15throundofCommercialCoalBlockAuctionscontaining17mines.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf"},{"claim":"For FY26, e-commerce earnings were driven by auctions of 10 coal mine blocks, over 200 major mineral blocks, scrap including plant sales, and coal linkage auctions.","quote":"10 coal mine blocks, over 200 major mineral blocks, significantly higher scrap including quite a few plant sales, as well as coal linkage auctions, the order for which MSTC obtained from Coal India Limited through competitive bidding.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The company completed the recovery of dues on the 110% BG model and closed the chapter on the trading and marketing segment.","quote":"We had taken a decision in FY26 to completely exit from the trading and marketing segment and have seamlessly recovered our dues on the 110% BG model, closing the chapter on this legacy segment in this quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"The company decided to exit the 110% bank guarantee business by the first quarter of the year.","quote":"So we have decided to exit, and by the first quarter of this year it will be out of our business basket.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Management highlighted global macroeconomic uncertainty as a challenge during the year.","quote":"So despite a considerable amount of global macroeconomic uncertainty, it's my pleasure to be able to report that MSTC has been able to end the year with good numbers.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The TReDS platform is expected to be operationalized sometime during FY27, subject to regulatory approvals.","quote":"This project is also at an advanced stage and subject to regulatory approvals being obtained, we should be able to operationalize this sometime during this FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"The company's internal target is to obtain RBI approval for the TReDS platform and operationalize it within FY27.","quote":"So, our internal target is hopefully FY27, within FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"MSTC Travel Portal for B2B is ready and currently being upgraded for future B2C operation.","quote":"MSTC Travel Portal for B2B is ready and currently being upgraded for\nFuture B2C operation.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"MSTC is developing a TREDs platform and has applied to RBI for requisite clearance.","quote":"MSTC is developing a TREDs platform and has applied to RBI for\nrequisite clearance.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"ETP for EPR certification has been developed on behalf of CPCB and is awaiting go ahead for operation.","quote":"ETP for EPR certification has been developed on behalf of CPCB and is\nawaiting go ahead for operation.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"The company is in the final stages of exiting from the marketing and trading business.","quote":"So as a part of this, we are now in the final stages of exiting from the marketing and trading business, and coupled with the strategic disinvestment of FSNL at the end of last fiscal, we are moving forward to being primarily an e-commerce company","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"The travel portal is in final developmental stages and expected to be launched shortly.","quote":"The two major such platforms that we are working on, the EPR, that is ETP, which we have already developed, and the next part of our digital project pipeline is a travel portal which is also in the final developmental stages and which we expect to launch shortly.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"The ETP portal for EPR certificates is ready and awaiting formal approval and launch for operations.","quote":"The portal is ready and is now awaiting formal approval and launch for operations.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"The company plans to exit the 110% bank guarantee business by the first quarter of this year.","quote":"So we have decided to exit, and by the first quarter of this year it will be out of our business basket.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf","timeframe":"Q1 FY27"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":22,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":6,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}